# LLM resolver cache. Deliberately NOT tracked: committing it would turn a runtime
# convenience into a checked-in lookup table over the evaluation suite's paraphrases,
# which is precisely the self-scoring this repo's audits exist to prevent. Every run
# must be free to re-derive its answers.
robustness/v2/.llm_resolver_cache.json
# Shipped resolver's runtime cache. Same reason as the research one: a committed cache of
# resolved paraphrases is a lookup table over evaluation vocabulary, and it would also
# ship answers the agent is supposed to derive.
submission/.llm_resolve_cache.json
robustness/v2/open_vocabulary/.pipeline_resolve_cache.json
robustness/v2/open_vocabulary/.resolver_cache_open_vocab.json

# MODEL CHECKPOINTS ARE NOT VERSIONED HERE. They live on the Hugging Face Hub:
#   KhiemGOM/techjam-route-classifier      dialogue-act router (Node 1)
#   KhiemGOM/techjam-scaffolding-tagger    content/scaffolding tagger
# Both resolve automatically at load time; set V2_ROUTE_MODEL_DIR or BERT_TAGGER_DIR to a
# local directory to override. Git LFS was tried and rejected: a history rewrite left a
# 134-byte pointer in the working tree instead of the weights, and the agent kept scoring
# its usual number because these layers are gated off clean traffic -- a dead model
# reported as a healthy run. A clone without `git lfs pull`, or past a bandwidth quota,
# reproduces exactly that. Hub resolution fails loudly instead.
submission/models/

# Training outputs and provider-response caches. Neither belongs in the repository:
# checkpoints are published to the Hugging Face Hub (see docs/MODEL_ARTIFACT_POLICY.md),
# and the prompt caches are per-experiment scratch. Both were UNIGNORED until an audit
# caught them -- a `git add -A` would have committed model weights back in, which is the
# exact problem the Hub migration existed to solve.
checkpoints/
robustness/v2/prompt_arm_caches/

# Branch-review scratch directory, created when reviewing a teammate branch locally.
.review-*/

# Provider-response caches under the new datasets path (the pre-move entry is stale).
experiments/datasets/prompt_arm_caches/
experiments/datasets/**/.*_cache*.json
